      "body": "Implemented the first measured session-signature milestone in PR #315: https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/pull/315\n\nThe server now quantizes evolved 512D manifold state into a deterministic 288-bit signature and feeds it into the existing graph emission-bias lane. Context signatures remain the only ROUT fallback input until calibration. Direct chat gets an order-sensitive history fallback. The same-eight-token/different-history A/B guard, integer-only runtime regression, docs, clippy, no-std checks, and full workspace suite all pass.",
